  {
   "id": "vengeance-of-mr-peppermint-250012@patch-2023-11-03",
   "gameId": "vengeance-of-mr-peppermint-250012",
   "displayName": "Patch on November 3",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-11-03T18:02:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A bunch of various changes, starting with Quality of Life related:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "there is now a list of available combo's in Pause menu;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "skip dialogue button for Keyboard control scheme is now Space (but Enter still works);",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "during fights you now have a Restart Fight button in the Pause menu, no need to wait for Lim to die to restart the fight;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "cursor is hidden during the gameplay, only reappears when any Meny is open;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Blackscreen dialogue text position was adjusted to be in the center of the screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Gameplay updates",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Light attack combo doesn't fill up Vengeance meter as fast as before;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "fifth Boss got stronger;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "the Grab/Hold of the enemy from now on is not endless, if you wait too long to finish off or throw enemy away - they will break the away;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "we disabled the game mechanic that throw-teleports punched enemies to the other side of the screen due to received feedback;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "we've added additional section to third level with different vibe and different set of enemies, should make that level more dynamic;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "we've added and changed sound effects for several enemies and several cutscenes in the game;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "cutscene music was updated on the third level and on the fifth level;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "and fixed several bugs.: Besides that we've added several Accessibility options to Gameplay and Audio tabs: screen reader, louder footsteps and additional audio cues. Our thanks to LirinTheBlindGuy for testing it out.: Have a nice day!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
